        "alt_text": "Bluesky Client\nv0.5.2\n\n源码仓库\n\nhttps://github.com/epheiamoe/bsky\n描述\n\nA dual-UI (TUI + PWA) Bluesky social client with AI integration. Built with React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and AT Protocol.\n\n在线演示\n\nhttps://ai-bsky.pages.dev\n提交\n\n798bb690e1b39d061e4466183a4425e58a192e43\n\n提交描述\n\nfix: widget content duplication + arrow click not working\n\n构建时间\n\n2026/5/7 19:42:20\n\n反馈问题\n\nhttps://github.com/epheiamoe/bsky/issues\n联系\n\nbsky@desuwa.org",
        "height": 747,
        "media_key": "3_2052359265621585920",
